                    "sense_definition": "Simple past and past participle of <w>cheek</w>.",
                    "learner_level": "C1",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "verb_form",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The student <w>cheeked</w> the teacher and was sent to the principal's office.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Ученик <w>дерзил</w> учителю и был отправлен к директору."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "He has <w>cheeked</w> his superiors one too many times.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Он уже слишком много раз <w>нахамил</w> своему начальству."
